flowchart TB
I["Owner goal"] --> D["Development: result and scope are clear"]
I --> A["Analysis: first answer a question and compare options"]
I --> S["Decomposition: goal does not fit in one plan"]
D --> R["Review and Architect decision"]
A --> R
S --> R
R --> CD["Development: commit and docs closeout"]
R --> CA["Analysis: plan commit, decision on the next work"]
R --> CS["Decomposition: umbrella plan is parked, work goes on in child plans"]
